<title>USA: Milwaukee Land stake cut by Orion group.</title>
<headline>Milwaukee Land stake cut by Orion group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Orion Capital Corp said Monday it has reduced its stake in Milwaukee Land Co to 79,300 common shares or 4.7 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the investor group said it sold 18,000 shares of the Chicago-based real estate company between May 12 and May 20 at $8.71 to $9.21 each.</p>
</text>
